    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n112524" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φύλαγμα</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">[ῠ]</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ατος</span>, τό, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				gloss on 
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔρυμα</span>
			, Sch.<i><span class="en">
				Th.
				6.66
			</span></i>; on <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἶλαρ,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				<u>EM</u>
				298.4
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>protection,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γῆ αἰώνιον φ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Secund.
					<u>Sent.</u>
					15
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Simp.
				<u>in Cat.</u>
				373.36
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>precept, commandment,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>Le.</u>
				8.35
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				22.9
			</span></i>, al., <i><span class="en">
				Jul.
				<u>Gal.</u>
				238c
			</span></i>.</div>
